# From "Energy Food" (Wave III - Freedom, CD3-5). The tape states plainly
# that this satisfies hunger directly -- kept at the user's request in the
# tape's own words rather than hedged.

@segment   energy-food
@title     Energy Food
@levels    F12
@duration  ~2m30s

say From Focus 12, here's a way to draw fresh energy directly into your system, whenever you want it.
pause 6
say Bring your center of consciousness into the palms of your hands.
pause 6
say Now let pure, white, radiant energy flow in from every direction of your expanded awareness — down into your palms, up through your arms, spreading through all of you. Refreshing. Invigorating.
pause 12
say Let it flow for as long as feels right.
hold 30
say Now let it close down. Bring your center of consciousness back to its normal place.
pause 6
say Relax, and notice how refreshed you feel.
pause 6
say From now on, whenever you want this: close your eyes, extend your hands palms-up, inhale deeply, and hold your breath. In that moment, picture the same radiant white energy centering on your palms and flowing up through you.
pause 10
say When you exhale and open your eyes, you will feel refreshed and rejuvenated, and you will no longer feel hunger for physical food, because your need has been satisfied.
pause 8
say The more you use this, the more strongly, rapidly, and surely your body responds to it — and the more effective it becomes, awake and waking.
pause 8
